  "summary_text": "Timeout settings and runbook and connection pool\nTimeout settings is not urgent\nRunbook is a bit of a black box\nRunbook is a nice to have\nReal issue may be logging format rather than runbook\nReal issue may be flaky integration tests rather than connection pool\nPreference to map out the edge cases rather than document the decision\nDead letter queue and slack thread and database indexes\nSuggestion to do it properly before touching dead letter queue\nSlack thread is not where i'd want it\nNotes on database indexes added to the doc\nBackfill job and dashboards and metrics\nNotes on backfill job added to the doc\nNo clear owner for dashboards\nOpen question: what the plan is for metrics\nNext steps\nTomás to run the Falcon dry run on staging by Monday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Timeout settings and runbook and connection pool\n- Timeout settings is not urgent\n- Runbook is a bit of a black box\n  - Runbook is a nice to have\n  - Real issue may be logging format rather than runbook\n- Real issue may be flaky integration tests rather than connection pool\n- Preference to map out the edge cases rather than document the decision\n\n### Dead letter queue and slack thread and database indexes\n- Suggestion to do it properly before touching dead letter queue\n- Slack thread is not where i'd want it\n- Notes on database indexes added to the doc\n\n### Backfill job and dashboards and metrics\n- Notes on backfill job added to the doc\n- No clear owner for dashboards\n- Open question: what the plan is for metrics\n\n### Next steps\n- Tomás to run the Falcon dry run on staging by **Monday**",
