    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So when I looked like at the pagination bug for Falcon, I had more questions than answers. But the annoying thing about the runbook is it's a bit messy. From my side, I don't know if the timeout settings is really the issue, more or less. And part of me wants to simplify it, part of me thinks it's half done. I feel like it's less about the test fixtures and more about the feedback, so yeah.",
