      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:29.245000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I mean.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:30.325000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:30.992000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, when I looked at the communication plan for Falcon, it's been quiet. Which, I don't know like if the backlog is really the issue.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:31.131000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:39.464000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:37.105000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:37.705000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Tomás Herrera"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:39.474000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:40.074000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Tomás Herrera"
      },
      "text": "I guess read replicas is a little fragile, but the action items is the obvious next thing. And then I wouldn't block on the backfill job.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:46.336000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:04:55.003000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:02.792000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:03.392000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I think the dependencies is pretty close and the timeout settings is the blocker,",
