      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:14.879000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "so it's on people's radar.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:14.944000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:16.611000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, Falcon is kind of the test case for the scope, at least for now...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:16.630000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:22.297000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually, my worry with the communication plan is that it creates more support load.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:22.396000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:27.063000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Tomás Herrera"
      },
      "text": "Same.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:25.843000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:26.443000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Also, I don't know if the incident review is really like the issue, for what it's worth.",
