      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:05:50.022000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I think there's a world where we test it with a few users and the requirements just goes away. But can we test it with a few users? But if the priority list slips again, the payments migration is going to feel it. I just want to make sure the dependencies doesn't fall through the cracks.",
