      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:06:33.403000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But the data folks keep asking about the dashboards, but yeah. And can we document the decision? And honestly staging deploy only needs about 30 tickets if we cut the scope. I guess my worry with the read replicas is that we're too optimistic. Anyway, part of me wants too do a proper write-up, part of me thinks it's the obvious next thing. Also, can we timebox it? But what would it take to get more data? The new folks mentioned the edge cases this morning, so it's on people's radar.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-15T14:06:33.500000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-15T14:07:03.833000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
